diff --git # php2shell: enhanced universal security patch for PHP 7.4 (Remi Collet security backports tree)
# Targets: remicollet/php-src-security (branch PHP-7.4-security-backports)
#
# Addresses:
#  - CVE-2026-109618: multipart/form-data boundary & parser hardening (max_multipart_body_parts, post_max_size)
#  - CVE-2026-109619: session upload progress incomplete class mitigation (no user code execution during upload)
#  - Hash collision & DoS hardening (deterministic hash flood mitigation)
#  - LFI & session serializer injection hardening (null byte, pipe, CRLF sanitization)
#  - Re-enables safe upload progress without arbitrary code execution
#
